1
00:00:00,708 --> 00:00:03,188
(Leonard:)I got to call her before
I forget how I said it.

2
00:00:05,012 --> 00:00:06,012
(Sheldon:)Hey.

3
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:07,960
(Penny:)-Hi. What's up?
-How's it going?

4
00:00:08,115 --> 00:00:09,425
(Leonard:)You taking Hollywood by storm?

5
00:00:09,583 --> 00:00:10,923
(Penny:)Actually,
I'm at The Cheesecake Factory.

6
00:00:11,085 --> 00:00:13,425
(Leonard:)You got your job back.
That is great news.

7
00:00:13,587 --> 00:00:16,537
(Leonard:)I didn't want to say anything,
but you are making the right choice.

8
00:00:16,691 --> 00:00:19,471
(Leonard:)To plunge yourself into debt right
now would be literally insane.

9
00:00:19,627 --> 00:00:22,197
(Penny:)Yeah. I'm just
returning my uniform.

10
00:00:24,899 --> 00:00:26,969
(Leonard:)And I support you.

11
00:00:33,474 --> 00:00:35,974
(Voice:)Before we begin your
guided meditation,

12
00:00:36,143 --> 00:00:39,753
(Voice:)close your eyes and picture
yourself in a peaceful environment.

13
00:00:40,548 --> 00:00:41,998
(Leonard:)Okay.

14
00:00:43,384 --> 00:00:46,994
(Sheldon:)I'm inside the CERN super collider.

15
00:00:48,556 --> 00:00:51,666
(Voice:)Now, take a deep, relaxing
breath in through your nose.

16
00:00:54,061 --> 00:00:55,841
(Voice:)And let it out.

17
00:00:55,996 --> 00:01:00,026
(Sheldon:)Wow. Didn't see that coming.

